Selected review transition logic is adapted from:
https://github.com/paperclipai/paperclip/blob/7b7c4d4172d6aac14919e2682b702ae87bc17653/server/src/services/issue-execution-policy.ts

Reused semantics: typed agent/user identity, default review-round cap of three,
human/current accepted reset, agent changes-requested increment, and sticky human hold.
Local changes: existing SpecGraph acceptances remain the sole decision ledger;
explicit independent run/thread assignment is required; self-review never auto-skips;
responsible humans must exist; native completion failures remain separate decisions.
No upstream server, task model, general policy framework or listener is included.

